• Section 3 Comments/Quotes: SVM was treated as the primary ML model and was compared with logistic regression. Random forest, gradient boosting, and deep-learning models were initially evaluated but rejected because of apparent overfitting. The authors used a separate split-sample validation set and additionally reported k-fold cross-validation, although the number of folds and implementation details were not provided. Feature-importance/local-explanation plots were presented, but no explicit feature-selection procedure or hyperparameter-search strategy was described.

